# Make.com (Integromat) webhook that fires the "thank you" automation
# when someone submits the join form (טופס הצטרפות).
#
# 1. In Make, create a scenario starting with a "Custom Webhook" module.
# 2. Copy the generated webhook URL.
# 3. Create a real ".env" file (copy this one) and paste the URL below.
# Vite only exposes vars prefixed with VITE_ to the browser.
VITE_MAKE_WEBHOOK_URL=https://hook.eu2.make.com/your-webhook-id-here
